yet 95\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/37-95.html\"}]}</script>\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri+Quran&family=Amiri:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Naskh+Arabic:wght@400;600&display=swap\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/theme.css\">\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/tr/\">Ana sayfa</a> › <a href=\"/tr/surah/37.html\">Sûre As-Saaffaat</a> › Âyet 95</nav><h1>Tefsiri: Sûre As-Saaffaat 37:95</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿قَالَ أَتَعْبُدُونَ مَا تَنْحِتُونَ﴾</p><section><h3>Meal</h3><p class=\"tr\">İbrahim onlara: &quot;Ellerinizle yonttuğunuz şeylere mi ibadet ediyorsunuz?&quot; dedi.</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">Turkish Translation - Rowwad Translation Center — v1.0.4 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">İki imamın sözleri, kaynaklarıyla birlikte, aslı olan Arapça metinle aynen verilmiştir.</p><section><h2>Şeyhülislam İbn Teymiyye</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">فجعل الأصنام منحوتة معمولة لهم<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 8/17</cite></blockquote></section><section><h2>İmam İbnü&#x27;l-Kayyim</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">وأن الآية وردت لبيان عدم استحقاق معبوديهم للعبادة لأنها مخلوقة لله وذكرنا شواهده من القرآن<cite>«بدائع الفوائد» 1/151</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=tr#s37a95\">Etkileşimli tefsirde aç (tam metinler)</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/tr/ayah/37-89.html\">Önceki âyet (37:89)</a><a href=\"/tr/ayah/37-96.html\">Sonraki âyet (37:96)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tefsîru&#x27;ş-Şeyhayn · <a href=\"/tr/\">Ana sayfa</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">Proje hakkında</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Gizlilik ve şartlar</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","ayah/37-96.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"tr\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tefsiri: As-Saaffaat 37:96 — İbn Teymiyye ve İbnü&#x27;l-Kayyim&#x27;e göre</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Oysa sizi de, yapmakta olduklarınızı da Allah yaratmıştır.\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/37-96.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/37-96.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/37-96.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/ayah/37-96.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ur\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ur/ayah/37-96.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"id\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/37-96.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"tr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/37-96.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fr/ayah/37-96.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"bn\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/bn/ayah/37-96.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ms\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ms/ayah/37-96.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fa\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fa/ayah/37-96.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ru\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ru/ayah/37-96.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"sw\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/ayah/37-96.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ha\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/37-96.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"es\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/es/ayah/37-96.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"de\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/ayah/37-96.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"zh\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/zh/ayah/37-96.html\">\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Tefsiri: As-Saaffaat 37:96 — İbn Teymiyye ve İbnü&#x27;l-Kayyim&#x27;e göre\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Oysa sizi de, yapmakta olduklarınızı da Allah yaratmıştır.\">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#1f4d3a\">\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/og.png\">\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\">\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Ana sayfa\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Sûre As-Saaffaat\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/surah/37.html\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"Âyet 96\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/37-96.html\"}]}</script>\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri+Quran&family=Amiri:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Naskh+Arabic:wght@400;600&display=swap\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/theme.css\">\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/tr/\">Ana sayfa</a> › <a href=\"/tr/surah/37.html\">Sûre As-Saaffaat</a> › Âyet 96</nav><h1>Tefsiri: Sûre As-Saaffaat 37:96</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿وَاللَّهُ خَلَقَكُمْ وَمَا تَعْمَلُونَ﴾</p><section><h3>Meal</h3><p class=\"tr\">Oysa sizi de, yapmakta olduklarınızı da Allah yaratmıştır.</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">Turkish Translation - Rowwad Translation Center — v1.0.4 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">İki imamın sözleri, kaynaklarıyla birlikte, aslı olan Arapça metinle aynen verilmiştir.</p><section><h2>Şeyhülislam İbn Teymiyye</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">فلا ننازعه في أن المراد بذلك الأصنام، فإن هذا هو أصح القولين. و &quot; ما &quot; بمعنى الذي، ومن قال: إنها مصدرية والمراد والله خلقكم وعملكم فهو ضعيف<cite>«منهاج السنة النبوية في نقض كلام الشيعة القدرية» 3/336</cite></blockquote><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">وإذا كان خالقا للمعمول وفيه أثر الفعل دل على أنه خالق لأفعال العباد.<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 8/17</cite></blockquote></section><section><h2>İmam İbnü&#x27;l-Kayyim</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">وليست مصدرية وإنما هي موصولة والمعنى والله خلقكم وخلق الذي تعملونه وتنحتونه من الأصنام فكيف تعبدونه وهو مخلوق لله ولو كانت مصدرية لكان الكلام إلى أن يكون حجة لهم أقرب من أن يكون حجة عليهم<cite>«بدائع الفوائد» 1/143</cite></blockquote><h3>Başkalarından naklettikleri</h3><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\"><span class=\"who\">من حمل «ما» على المصدرية</span> <span class=\"st\">رجّح غيره</span> «بحمل ما على المصدر أي خلقكم وأعمالكم»<cite>«شفاء العليل في مسائل القضاء والقدر والحكمة والتعليل» 1/110</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=tr#s37a96\">Etkileşimli tefsirde aç (tam metinler)</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/tr/ayah/37-95.html\">Önceki âyet (37:95)</a><a href=\"/tr/ayah/37-103.html\">Sonraki âyet (37:103)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tefsîru&#x27;ş-Şeyhayn · <a href=\"/tr/\">Ana sayfa</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">Proje hakkında</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Gizlilik ve şartlar</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n"}